[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558255312","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100719#issuecomment-2558255312","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100719","id":2558255312,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ye-DQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T22:20:49Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T22:20:49Z","body":"I assume that the progress updates when processing either in `_process` or in `_physics_process`, try doing this outside of `_ready`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558255312/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558260228","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100719#issuecomment-2558260228","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100719","id":2558260228,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ye_QE","user":{"login":"EricXu1728","id":73031279,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDMxMjc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73031279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricXu1728","html_url":"https://github.com/EricXu1728","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricXu1728/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricXu1728/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricXu1728/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricXu1728/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricXu1728/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricXu1728/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricXu1728/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricXu1728/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricXu1728/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T22:47:32Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T22:47:32Z","body":"> I assume that the progress updates when processing either in `_process` or in `_physics_process`, try doing this outside of `_ready`\n\nThis also does not work in the process:\n\n```godot\nextends PathFollow3D\n\nvar has_processed = false\n\nfunc _process(delta):\n\tif not has_processed:\n\t\thas_processed = true \n\t\t\n\t\tvar i = 10\n\t\tfor n in i:\n\t\t\tvar progress = (100 / i) * n\n\t\t\tself.progress_ratio = progress\n\t\t\tprint(self.progress)\n\t\t\tprint(self.transform)\n\n```\nIn fact, it introduces new weirder error where self.progress is always the minimum or maximum length of the curve\n```\nGodot Engine v4.3.stable.mono.official.77dcf97d8 - https://godotengine.org\nVulkan 1.3.280 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\n\n0\n[X: (0.460565, -0, 0.887626), Y: (0.03469, 0.999236, -0.018), Z: (-0.886948, 0.039081, 0.460213), O: (-2.73196, 0.481295, 1.19287)]\n13.9340238571167\n[X: (0.460565, -0, 0.887626), Y: (0.03469, 0.999236, -0.018), Z: (-0.886948, 0.039081, 0.460213), O: (-2.73196, 0.481295, 1.19287)]\n13.9340238571167\n\n```\n\nIt does behave normally if it isn't done all at once, but this is still restrictive of what can be done with the follow node:\n```godot\nextends PathFollow3D\n\nvar i = 10\nvar n = 0  \n\nfunc _process(delta):\n\tif n < i:\n\t\tvar progress = (100 / i) * n\n\t\tself.progress_ratio = progress\n\t\tprint(\"Progress:\", self.progress_ratio)\n\t\tprint(\"Transform:\", self.transform)\n\t\tn += 1 \n```\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558260228/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558260317","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100719#issuecomment-2558260317","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100719","id":2558260317,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ye_Rd","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repo